if () then ([v2 = 'found'])
:found reusable ideas from previous campaigns;
:create a new concept;
else ([v2 = 'not found'])
:create a new concept;
endif
:integrate new ideas and add further points;
:integrate the revised campaign into the database;
:present the concept to the relevant party for consideration;
:was the concept accepted;
:v3: was the concept accepted ({declined, accepted}); <<objectSignal>>
if () then ([v3 = 'declined'])
:rework the concept;
:You have completed this procedure;
stop
else ([v3 = 'accepted'])
:present the concept to the customer;
:You have completed this procedure;
stop
